// RA1 fixture: the arsenal of the small two sided world (schema version 3). The engineer is
// trained by any barracks of either side (a prerequisite group, both owner sides); the sniper is
// the special of country alpha and needs any radar; the raider is forbidden to alpha (as the
// Harrier is to Korea); the militia is a Soviet unit without prerequisites, so that only the
// side of the barracks decides; the prototype cannot be queued (tech level -1) and the advanced
// trooper lies above the fixture's tech level 5; the turret has no owner sides and needs any
// barracks; the storm device is a superweapon; the hovercraft is a transport that carries two
// units, vehicles included. Since schema version 3 (RA2) every building may be placed within
// 5 free cells of another (the reach of the economy file's placement distance of 6), the two
// radars are radar buildings, and the turret and the storm device stop under low power.
// Fixture data (invariant I10).
